{"type":"npc","name":"Staccarix","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":320,"temp":0,"max":320,"details":""},"ac":{"value":39,"details":"hateful reformation, void healing"},"allSaves":{"value":"+1 status to all saves vs. magic"},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":80}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects","exceptions":[]},{"type":"disease","exceptions":[]},{"type":"fire","exceptions":[]},{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"unconscious","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"holy","value":15,"exceptions":[]},{"type":"vitality","value":15,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","necril","pyric","sussuran","venenan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":17},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Even the phoenix, the embodiment of radiant life conquering death, is not immune to the twisted magic of necromancy. A staccarix, or ash phoenix, is the antithesis of everything a living phoenix represents. They seek out libraries and repositories of lore only to scorch them all to cinders, and they gleefully spread suffering and death everywhere they go. The only characteristic that staccarixes share with living phoenixes is their capacity for self-resurrection, a terrifying thought for all who seek to destroy these monstrosities for good.</p><h2>Book Burner</h2><p>A staccarix hates knowledge and seems determined to sink the world into a state of ignorance from which it can never recover. It's theorized that some library somewhere in the world must contain the secret to permanently destroying a staccarix, and that staccarixes are determined to destroy this lost knowledge before some researcher happens upon it.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 1,875/4,300/8,000 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing), armor (light), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Deception, Intimidation, Nature, Religion)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, burning barbs, charisma, death, electricity, elongating, energy resistant (fire, void), fire, fire shield, ice, mirrored, poison, poisonous armor, sensory (darkvision), spells (Divine: @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.9HpwDN4MYQJnW0LG]{Dispel Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.Z9OrRXKgAPv6Hn5l]{Execute}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.jrBa9deU2ULFWvSl]{Falling Stars}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.wdA52JJnsuQWeyqz]{Harm}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.10VcmSYNBrvBphu1]{Massacre}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.CeSh8QcVnqP5OlLj]{Pinpoint}, @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spells.jwK43yKsHTkJQvQ9]{See the Unseen}), spiked, strength, sturdy, throwing, unholy, wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Arun Varma","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":7},"con":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":10}},"perception":{"details":"smoke vision","mod":30,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"see-invisibility"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":29,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":32,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":26,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":33},"athletics":{"base":31},"deception":{"base":31},"intimidation":{"base":33},"nature":{"base":30},"religion":{"base":30}},"traits":{"value":["fire","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"grg"}}},"_id":"9ojfqM3d8OzCevsw","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/staccarixx-v2.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Staccarix","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":4,"height":4,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/staccarixx-v2.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offset